  (text "LITE LED head: 66 x Osram SFH 4545 (950nm, +/-5deg) - 33 strings of 2 on the 4 x AA NiMH pack" (at 15.24 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid fe73ca31-2adf-5d97-afd4-5d76e114bb52))
  (text "I = (VBAT - 2 x 1.5V) / 24R: 100mA on fresh cells (5.4V), 75-83mA for most of the discharge.  ~3A peak, ~0.9A average while sending; switched at 38/40kHz by the control board (one low-side switch on LED_RTN; the supply itself is only on while ARM is high)." (at 15.24 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ee63f1d4-3efd-55bd-a0f2-108a99ec3ec9))
  (text "14 x 5 grid, corners empty (M3 holes): rows of 6 / 7 / 7 / 7 / 6 strings, none crosses rows. Resistors on the back." (at 15.24 26.67 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 2c9d5ba3-17cd-57f0-903f-791fa4cc439d))
